# Copy this file to company/.env.local and put your own key in it.
#
#   cp company/.env.local.example company/.env.local
#
# company/.env.local is gitignored, so it never leaves your machine through git.
# Get a free key at https://api.data.gov/signup/ . It arrives by email in about a minute.
# The same key works for the SAM.gov Get Opportunities API and other api.data.gov endpoints.
#
# The key is used by /sync and /backfill, which build the local copy of the SAM.gov
# notices in data/sam.db. /find-opps searches that local copy and never uses the key.
# The API is rate limited to 10 requests a day for a non-federal user with no role on
# an entity registration, and 1,000 a day for a user who holds a role on one. That is
# why the kit syncs once and searches locally.
#
# Do not put the key in this file. Do not paste it into a chat. Do not commit it.

SAM_API_KEY=
